   c) Retain proprietary rights over your own application code.

3. RESTRICTIONS & CONDITIONS

   3.1 Change Disclosure Requirement (Open Source Only)
   If you distribute a Modified Version of NimLib under Section 2.1, you
   MUST include a prominent notice in the source code and documentation
   stating:
   a) That the Software has been modified from the original NimLib.
   b) The date of the modification.
   c) A clear summary of the changes made (e.g., via a CHANGELOG file, or header comments).

   Example Notice:
   "This version of NimLib was modified by [Your Name] on [Date].
   Changes include: [List of specific changes]."

